title: "ReconStream: A Temporal Correctness Contract for Streaming Financial Reconciliation"
abstract: >-
  A temporal correctness contract for reconciliation on asynchronous streams,
  a checker that decides verdict admissibility without ground truth, and an
  evaluation of four deployed reconciliation idioms plus an Apache Flink
  interval join against it.
